      "description": "The sole navigation link beside the home-linked text brand and theme toggle.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a href=\"/posts\" aria-current=\"page\">文章</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:1.6rem;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans);}.ds-nav a{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:.4rem .1rem;color:var(--site-muted);font-size:.875rem;text-decoration:none;}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"],.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--site-link);}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:3px;left:.1rem;right:.1rem;height:2px;background:var(--site-link);}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--site-link);outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-nav{gap:.8rem;}.ds-nav a{font-size:.8rem;}}"
